# Stackra file contract:
# Purpose: the ignore rules of this service member: everything `stackra gen` writes stays out of
#          git. The committed contract, stackra.manifest.json and openapi.json, sits at the member
#          root, outside .stackra/. Same rule set as the root .gitignore, repeated so the member
#          folder keeps it when copied elsewhere.
# Boundary: ignore rules only.
# Runtime: node
# Governing contract: Stackra ADR 0294 decision 10 (generated output is never authored), ADR 0295
#                     decision 5 (generated tool configs and their root shims)

# everything gen writes: the runtime entry, the gen modules, tool configs, compiled migration SQL
# and the Encore app
.stackra/*
# the root shim of the generated Vitest config, for tools that read only the member root
/vitest.config.ts
# template only: the generated samples are committed so they can be read beside their source; a
# real project drops this line once `stackra gen` runs in it
!.stackra/**
